OL,3,GNEWSAHalf of fire service 2025
OL,4,Acall-outs 'false alarms'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half of the emergency
OL,7,Fcall-outs to Guernsey's fire service in
OL,8,F2025 turned out to be false alarms, a
OL,9,Freport has revealed.
OL,11,FGuernsey Fire and Rescue Service (GFRS)
OL,12,Fattended what it said was a record
OL,13,F1,412 incidents last year, but was not
OL,14,Frequired for 726 of them. Six were
OL,15,Fdescribed as "malicious false alarms".
OL,17,FThe figures were revealed as part of
OL,18,FGFRS's community risk management plan
OL,19,Fdocument, which has laid out draft
OL,20,Fproposals for the next three years to
OL,21,F"strengthen the resilience of the
OL,22,Fisland".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
