OL,3,GNEWSAHalf of fire service 2025
OL,4,Acall-outs 'false alarms'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGFRS said its staff being called to
OL,7,Fincidents where there were no fires was
OL,8,F"placing increasing and avoidable
OL,9,Fdemand on the service".
